IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `pip-nouns`
IMPORT `pip-sch1-daily-living-table`
IMPORT `pip-sch1-mobility-table`

-- Tests of Schedule 1, Parts 2 and 3: the points of every descriptor, as printed in column 3 of
-- the tables (lines 566 to 635 of the text), the count of descriptors of each activity, and the
-- explicit not-covered constructor of each activity.

GIVEN r IS A MAYBE `a row of Schedule 1`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`the points in the row` r MEANS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST x THEN JUST (x's `its points`)

GIVEN r IS A MAYBE `a row of Schedule 1`
GIVETH A MAYBE `an activity of Schedule 1`
`the activity of the row` r MEANS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST x THEN JUST (x's `its activity`)

